msgstr "Starpniekservera porta numurs"

#: include/global_settings.php:2332
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication."
msgstr "TCP ports šifrētai saziņai."

#: include/global_settings.php:2339 include/global_settings.php:2371
#: utilities.php:282
msgid "RSA Fingerprint"
msgstr "RSA pirkstu nospiedums"

#: include/global_settings.php:2340
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the proxy is using. This is required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Pašreizējās publiskās RSA atslēgas pirksta nospiedums, ko izmanto starpniekserveris. Tas ir nepieciešams, lai izveidotu uzticamu savienojumu."

#: include/global_settings.php:2347
msgid "RRDtool Proxy Server - Backup"
msgstr "RRDtool starpniekserveris — dublējums"

#: include/global_settings.php:2352
msgid "Load Balancing"
msgstr "Slodzes līdzsvarošana"

#: include/global_settings.php:2353
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Ja ir saņemams gan galvenais, gan rezerves starpniekserveris, šī opcija ļauj izplatīt visus pieprasījumus pret RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php:2358
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "RRDtool rezerves starpniekservera DNS resursdatora nosaukums vai IP adrese, ja starpniekserveris darbojas MSR režīmā."

#: include/global_settings.php:2364
msgid "TCP port for encrypted communication with the backup proxy."
msgstr "TCP ports šifrētai saziņai ar rezerves starpniekserveri."

#: include/global_settings.php:2372
msgid "The fingerprint of the current public RSA key the backup proxy is using. This required to establish a trusted connection."
msgstr "Pašreizējās publiskās RSA atslēgas pirkstu nospiedums, ko izmanto rezerves starpniekserveris. Tas ir nepieciešams, lai izveidotu uzticamu savienojumu."

#: include/global_settings.php:2381
msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Spike Kill iestatījumi"

#: include/global_settings.php:2386
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Izņemšanas metode"

#: include/global_settings.php:2387
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Ir divas noņemšanas metodes. Pirmais, standarta novirze, noņems visus paraugus, kas ir X standarta noviržu skaita attālumā no paraugu vidējā lieluma. Otrā metode, dispersija, noņems visus paraugus, kas ir par X% vairāk nekā vidējā atšķirība. Variances metode ņem vērā noteiktu skaitu “izviržu”. Tie ir izņēmuma paraugi, piemēram, smaile, kas ir jāizslēdz no dispersijas vidējās aprēķina."

#: include/global_settings.php:2391
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Standarta novirze"

#: include/global_settings.php:2392
msgid "Variance Based w/Outliers Removed"
msgstr "Variance Based W/Outliers noņemts"

#: include/global_settings.php:2396 lib/html.php:2318
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Aizstāšanas metode"

#: include/global_settings.php:2397
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Ir trīs aizstāšanas metodes. Pirmā metode smaili aizstāj ar attiecīgā datu avota vidējo vērtību. Otrā metode smaili aizstāj ar \"NaN\". Pēdējais aizstāj smaili ar pēdējo zināmo atrasto labo vērtību."

#: include/global_settings.php:2401 lib/html.php:2314
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Vidēji"

#: include/global_settings.php:2402 lib/html.php:2315
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "NaN's"

#: include/global_settings.php:2403 lib/html.php:2316
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Pēdējā zināmā labā"

#: include/global_settings.php:2407
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Standarta noviržu skaits"

#: include/global_settings.php:2408
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Visas vērtības, kas ir tik daudz standarta novirzes virs vidējās vērtības, tiks izslēgtas. Labs skaits būs atkarīgs no izmantojamo datu veida. Mēs iesakām skaitli, kas nav mazāks par 5 standarta novirzēm."

#: include/global_settings.php:2412 include/global_settings.php:2413
#: include/global_settings.php:2414 include/global_settings.php:2415
#: include/global_settings.php:2416 include/global_settings.php:2417
#: include/global_settings.php:2418 include/global_settings.php:2419
#: include/global_settings.php:2420 include/global_settings.php:2421
#: include/global_settings.php:2422 include/global_settings.php:2423
#: include/global_settings.php:2424
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "%d Standarta novirzes"

#: include/global_settings.php:2428 lib/html.php:2330
msgid "Variance Percentage"
msgstr "Izkliedes procents"

#: include/global_settings.php:2429
#, php-format
msgid "This value represents the percentage above the adjusted sample average once outliers have been removed from the sample.  For example, a Variance Percentage of 100%% on an adjusted average of 50 would remove any sample above the quantity of 100 from the graph."
msgstr "Šī vērtība ir procentuālā daļa virs koriģētā parauga vidējā rādītāja, kad no parauga ir izņemtas novirzes. Piemēram, novirzes procents 100%% ar koriģēto vidējo vērtību 50 no diagrammas noņemtu jebkuru paraugu, kas pārsniedz 100."

#: include/global_settings.php:2452
msgid "Variance Number of Outliers"
msgstr "Izviržu skaits"

#: include/global_settings.php:2453
msgid "This value represents the number of high and low average samples will be removed from the sample set prior to calculating the Variance Average.  If you choose an outlier value of 5, then both the top and bottom 5 averages are removed."
msgstr "Šī vērtība apzīmē augsto un zemo vidējo paraugu skaitu, kas tiks noņemti no paraugu kopas pirms dispersijas vidējās aprēķināšanas. Ja izvēlaties ārējo vērtību 5, tiek noņemti gan augšējie, gan apakšējie 5 vidējie rādītāji."

#: include/global_settings.php:2457 include/global_settings.php:2458
#: include/global_settings.php:2459 include/global_settings.php:2460
#: include/global_settings.php:2461 include/global_settings.php:2462
#: include/global_settings.php:2463 include/global_settings.php:2464
#: include/global_settings.php:2465 include/global_settings.php:2466
#: include/global_settings.php:2467 include/global_settings.php:2468
#: include/global_settings.php:2469
#, php-format
msgid "%d High/Low Samples"
msgstr "%d augsti/zemi paraugi"

#: include/global_settings.php:2473
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Max Kills uz RRA"

#: include/global_settings.php:2474
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Šī vērtība norāda maksimālo smaiļu skaitu, kas jānoņem no diagrammas RRA."

